        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Tiene sentido. Voy a probarlo esta semana.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Faz sentido. Vou testar isso nesta semana.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/8113b4a0d6094f4183b97cbaa0382737_b08-linea-04-tiene-sentido-voy-a-probarlo-esta-semana.mp3?Expires=1794099719&Signature=RgIOCFrWLJlRprVXbFapA-HbUSaqI-dvjLeTex4wSsdtykyWooKq2xpZ~ElNxkKQT2Dygu6SzBMS~Lg0Mzdm0qajAk7lMsD-zXy3vmsd4f60tzL00x0byHuYweVv0WZAAqoUMERiXX2X3ir8nT6zWWCv-GycuW7RGNH0W~PqI7VOFhh8ao5C~-2yju3ZcKGyk1l93sJxKqZnr7b1ue-lf1KStjbTM6t8qGMos0WaS1yR7HM6bzVFQkYKx0OlxdqxruN6ykFa4l9UZzx~8VXfFdK-qS8FSkLJHc5PFNR5uYyVGCuVPqxAXFpLEuf7pxB2iFgs9CSGkVObJuZkXhJgHw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
